Birth Rate and Death Rate Analysis

Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing crude birth rates and crude death rates across different countries over time.

The objective is to explore demographic trends, understand population changes, and identify potential relationships between birth rates and death rates.

Datasets

Two datasets are currently being used:

crude-birth-rate.csv: Contains crude birth rate data for 253 entities from 1950 to 2023.

crude-death-rate.csv: Contains annual crude death rate data for 253 entities from 1950 to 2023.

